===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno}} and {{etyl|frm}} {{term|oyez|lang=xno}}, {{term|oiez}}, imperative plural of {{term|oir||to hear}}, from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|ouïr||to hear|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|audire||to hear|lang=la}}.

